msgstr ""

#: ../../../GettingStartedVS.md:199
msgid ""
"There is also a Windows [Dockerfile](https://github.com/llvm/llvm-zorg/blob/"
"main/buildbot/google/docker/windows-base-vscode2019/Dockerfile) with the "
"entire build toolchain. This can be used to test the build with a toolchain "
"different from your host installation or to create build servers."
msgstr ""

